 here Property Tiles Component </p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center\" id=\"pt_tiles_cta_wrapper\"><a class=\"block text-[15px]/[26px] uppercase h-[55px] py-[13px] px-[20px] rounded-[100px] border-[2px] text-[#000] border-[#000] hover:bg-[var(--primary-color)] hover:!text-[#fff] hover:border-[var(--primary-color)] transition duration-300 ease-in-out font-semibold\" data-redirect=\"luxury-stays\" href=\"#\" id=\"pt_tiles_cta_button\"> Explore more places to stay </a></div></div></div></section><section content-type=\"faq\" data-chunk-index=\"7\" data-chunk-session=\"session_1793771146579_kfs6px7\" data-collab-id=\"sec-body-7-89c07a3c\" id=\"accordion-feeds\"><div class=\"presto-container pt-[40px] pb-[120px]\" content-type=\"faq\" id=\"accordion-feeds-container\"><div class=\"rounded-[10px] border-2 border-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--secondary-color)_22%,#fff)] bg-[linear-gradient(color-mix(in_srgb,var(--secondary-color)_10%,#fff),color-mix(in_srgb,var(--secondary-color)_10%,#fff))] p-[20px] lg:p-[50px]\" content-type=\"faq\" id=\"accordion-card\"><div id=\"accordion_intro_wrapper\"><div id=\"accordion_intro\"><h3 class=\"accordion_heading font-(family-name:--heading-font-family)\" id=\"accordion_heading\"> Frequently Asked Questions </h3></div></div><div class=\"accordion-wrap mt-[5px]\" content-type=\"faq\" id=\"accordion_wrap\"><div class=\"accordion\" content-type=\"faq\" id=\"accordion_container\"><div class=\"faq-container\" content-type=\"faq-item-set\" id=\"faq_items_container\"><div class=\"faq-item border-b border-[#D2D2D2] py-[22px] cursor-pointer\" content-type=\"faq-item\" data-faq-item=\"\" id=\"faq_item_1\"><div class=\"qn-wrap\" id=\"faq_qn_wrap_1\"><h4 class=\"pb-[10px] xl:pb-[0px] question font-(family-name:--heading-font-family)\" id=\"faq-ques-1\"> What makes Punta Mita so unique? </h4><span class=\"toggle-icon\" id=\"faq_toggle_icon_1\"></span></div><p class=\"answer text-[#818181] py-[15px]\" id=\"faq-ans-1\"> The Punta Mita offer untouched natural beauty with dramatic cliffs, waterfalls, and remote fjords. They blend Nordic culture with rich traditions and warm hospitality. </p></div><div class=\"faq-item border-b border-[#D2D2D2] py-[22px] cursor-pointer\" content-type=\"faq-item\" data-faq-item=\"\" id=\"faq_item_2\"><div class=\"qn-wrap\" id=\"faq_qn_wrap_2\"><h4 class=\"pb-[10px] xl:pb-[0px] question font-(family-name:--heading-font-family)\" id=\"faq-ques-2\"> What types of accommodations do you offer in Punta Mita? </h4><span class=\"toggle-icon\" id=\"faq_toggle_icon_2\"></span></div><p class=\"answer text-[#818181] py-[15px]\" id=\"faq-ans-2\"> We offer a range of stays including cozy cabins, seaside cottages, and luxury lodges. Each accommodation is handpicked for its comfort, charm, and stunning location. Whether you seek solitude or adventure, we have the perfect place for you. </p></div><div class=\"faq-item border-b border-[#D2D2D2] py-[22px] cursor-pointer\" content-type=\"faq-item\" data-faq-item=\"\" id=\"faq_item_3\"><div class=\"qn-wrap\" id=\"faq_qn_wrap_3\"><h4 class=\"pb-[10px] xl:pb-[0px] question font-(family-name:--heading-font-family)\" id=\"faq-ques-3\"> Can I expect privacy at your Punta Mita properties? </h4><span class=\"toggle-icon\" id=\"faq_toggle_icon_3\"></span></div><p class=\"answer text-[#818181] py-[15px]\" id=\"faq-ans-3\"> Yes, we prioritize your privacy. Whether you\u2019re staying in a secluded villa or a luxurious resort, each of our properties is designed to offer a peaceful and private retreat, allowing you to unwind and enjoy the beauty of the Island without distractions. </p></div><div class=\"faq-item border-b border-[#D2D2D2] py-[22px] cursor-pointer\" content-type=\"faq-item\" data-faq-item=\"\" id=\"faq_item_4\"><div class=\"qn-wrap\" id=\"faq_qn_wrap_4\"><h4 class=\"pb-[10px] xl:pb-[0px] question font-(family-name:--heading-font-family)\" id=\"faq-ques-4\"> When is the best time to visit the Punta Mita? </h4><span class=\"toggle-icon\" id=\"faq_toggle_icon_4\"></span></div><p class=\"answer text-[#818181] py-[15px]\" id=\"faq-ans-4\"> The best time to visit is from May to September when the weather is milder and the days are longer. You\u2019ll experience lush green landscapes, birdwatching, and cultural events. This period offers the most accessible travel and outdoor adventures. </p></div><div class=\"faq-item border-b border-[#D2D2D2] py-[22px] cursor-pointer\" content-type=\"faq-item\" data-faq-item=\"\" id=\"faq_item_5\"><div class=\"qn-wrap\" id=\"faq_qn_wrap_5\"><h4 class=\"pb-[10px] xl:pb-[0px] question font-(family-name:--heading-font-family)\" id=\"faq-ques-5\"> Is it easy to travel around the Punta Mita? </h4><span class=\"toggle-icon\" id=\"faq_toggle_icon_5\"></span></div><p class=\"answer text-[#818181] py-[15px]\" id=\"faq-ans-5\"> Yes, the islands are well-connected by roads, tunnels, ferries, and bridges. Car rentals are popular and offer the most flexibility for exploring. Public buses and inter-island ferries also run on regular schedules. </p></div><div class=\"faq-item py-[22px] cursor-pointer\" content-type=\"faq-item\" data-faq-item=\"\" id=\"faq_item_6\"><div class=\"qn-wrap\" id=\"faq_qn_wrap_6\"><h4 class=\"pb-[10px] xl:pb-[0px] question font-(family-name:--heading-font-family)\" id=\"faq-ques-6\"> How accurate is the pricing shown for a particular property? </h4><span class=\"toggle-icon\" id=\"faq_toggle_icon_6\"></span></div><p class=\"answer text-[#818181] py-[15px]\" id=\"faq-ans-6\"> We strive to show accurate pricing for a property based on the lowest nightly rate we have been able to find for a property. For the most accurate pricing, please input your date range and search for the property. You will be referred over to the partner or the property owner's own website to confirm the specific pricing. We are working on functionality to find you the best price across multiple websites for the property you are interested in. Stay tuned as we refine this feature. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-chunk-index=\"8\" data-chunk-session=\"session_1793771146579_kfs6px7\" data-collab-id=\"sec-body-8-a590132c\" id=\"property-search-section\"><div class=\"bg-[var(--primary-color)]\" id=\"property-search-bg\"><div class=\"presto-container max-w-[1585px] min-w-[200px] ml-[auto] mr-[auto] pl-[20px] pr-[20px] md:pl-[30px] md:pr-[30px] 2xl:pl-[50px] 2xl:pr-[50px]\" id=\"property-search-container\"><div class=\"pt-[50px] pb-[50px] lg:pb-[80px] lg:pt-[80px]\" id=\"ft-property-search-wrapper\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center\"><h3 class=\"py-[15px] text-center font-(family-name:--heading-font-family) text-[#fff]\" id=\"property-search-heading\"> Find Your Perfect Stay in Punta Mita, Mexico </h3><div class=\"w-full text-white pt-[16px] pb-[16px] text-center max-w-[1279px]\" id=\"property-search-component-wrapper\"><div class=\"text-inherit text-base component_wrapper psb_icon\" id=\"icon_propery_search\"><p class=\"text-white italic text-center\"> Add here Property Search Component </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main>"}, "faq": [{"question": "What makes Punta Mita so unique?", "answer": "The Punta Mita offer untouched natural beauty with dramatic cliffs, waterfalls, and remote fjords. They blend Nordic culture with rich traditions and warm hospitality."}, {"question": "What types of accommodations do you offer in Punta Mita?", "answer": "We offer a range of stays including cozy cabins, seaside cottages, and luxury lodges. Each accommodation is handpicked for its comfort, charm, and stunning location. Whether you seek solitude or adventure, we have the perfect place for you."}, {"question": "Can I expect privacy at your Punta Mita properties?", "answer": "Yes, we prioritize your privacy. Whether you\u2019re staying in a secluded villa or a luxurious resort, each of our properties is designed to offer a peaceful and private retreat, allowing you to unwind and enjoy the 